# Keeps this directory in git.
#
# The binaries here are build output (scripts/build-go-tools.sh) and are
# gitignored, but the DIRECTORY must exist in a clean checkout: the
# Dockerfile does `COPY pd_runner/bin/ ...`, and COPY of an absent
# directory fails the build outright with an opaque
#   "failed to calculate checksum ... /pd_runner/bin: not found"
#
# The Dockerfile guards each tool with `if [ -f ... ]`, so an EMPTY
# directory builds fine and degrades at runtime, which is what its
# comment ("the build succeeds even if some binaries are missing")
# always intended. Found by the first fresh-install rehearsal.
